    "en": "WOIM is a rock pushing, egg cracking, worm snipping puzzle game! Explore the world beneath our feet, digging deeper and deeper into the earth below. Solve tricky puzzles, using the tools at your disposal Snip yourself in half to get a helping hand Discover secrets hidden around the world Across 4 worlds, over 50 puzzles, and many secrets you'll find yourself: 🍎 Eating apples 🚪 Opening doors 🟫 Eating dirt 🪨 Pushing rocks 🥚 Carrying eggs 🔵 Pressing buttons 🧩 Solving jigsaws 👒 Wearing many hats? and much more!"
